---

## 🚀 Workflow

### 1️⃣ Record Gait

* Open app → Start recording
* Walk for 5 seconds
* Data saved locally

### 2️⃣ Train Model

* Move data → backend/data
* Run training script

### 3️⃣ Authenticate

* Select walk
* Send to backend
* Get prediction + confidence

---

## 📈 Performance

* ✅ Accuracy: 85–95%
* ⚡ Prediction Time: <500ms
* 📊 Features: ~48 per sample

---

## 🛡️ Security

* Data stored locally
* No personal data transmitted
* Input validation implemented
* API protection mechanisms

---

## 🔧 Configuration

### Change Backend URL

Update in `dataUtils.js`:

```javascript
fetch('http://<YOUR_IP>:5000/predict')
```

---

## 🔍 Troubleshooting

* ❌ Server not connecting → Check IP + network
* ❌ Low accuracy → Add more training data
* ❌ Model issues → Verify `.pkl` files

